==English==
===Verb===
'''to take the cake'''
#{{idiom}} (''US'') To be especially [[good]] or [[outstanding]].  
#:''Thanks!  You guys '''take the cake'''.''
#{{idiom}} (''US'') To be particularly [[bad]], [[objectionable]], or [[egregious]].{{jump|to be particularly bad or egregious|s}}
#:''I've seen bad grammar, but this '''takes the cake'''.''

